WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:07.682
Mr Saeed: Hello! Welcome to English Path. Unit one, lesson one. Introductions.

2
00:00:11.382 --> 00:00:14.663
Mr Saeed: Good morning! Welcome to the class.

3
00:00:14.663 --> 00:00:18.280
Fahad: Good morning! I'm Fahad. I'm a new student.

4
00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:22.493
Mr Saeed: Hello, Fahad. I'm Mr Saeed. I'm your teacher.

5
00:00:22.493 --> 00:00:25.028
Fahad: Nice to meet you, Mr Saeed.

6
00:00:25.028 --> 00:00:28.209
Mr Saeed: Nice to meet you, too. Sit down, please.

7
00:00:32.909 --> 00:00:37.053
Ali: Hello! I'm Ali. What's your name?

8
00:00:37.053 --> 00:00:39.279
Fahad: My name's Fahad.

9
00:00:39.279 --> 00:00:43.134
Ali: Nice to meet you, Fahad. This is Sara.

10
00:00:43.134 --> 00:00:47.808
Sara: Hi, Fahad! I'm Sara. I'm your classmate.

11
00:00:47.808 --> 00:00:49.626
Fahad: Nice to meet you, Sara.

12
00:00:52.526 --> 00:00:57.773
Mr Saeed: Let's look at the grammar. I am Fahad. I'm Fahad.

13
00:00:57.773 --> 00:01:01.899
Mr Saeed: I'm is the short form of I am.
I'm = أنا

14
00:01:01.899 --> 00:01:04.152
Mr Saeed: I'm = أنا

15
00:01:07.052 --> 00:01:11.226
Mr Saeed: My name's Ali. My is for me.
my = لي

16
00:01:11.226 --> 00:01:15.601
Mr Saeed: What's your name? Your is for you.
your = لك

17
00:01:15.601 --> 00:01:20.416
Mr Saeed: my = لي   ·   your = لك

18
00:01:20.416 --> 00:01:26.020
Mr Saeed: Ask: What's your name? Answer: My name's Sara. Or, I'm Sara.

19
00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:34.520
Mr Saeed: Use this is to introduce a person. Ali, this is Sara.
This is = هذا / هذه

20
00:01:34.520 --> 00:01:37.571
Mr Saeed: Answer: Nice to meet you.

21
00:01:37.571 --> 00:01:41.561
Mr Saeed: This is = لتقديم شخص

22
00:01:44.461 --> 00:01:47.084
Mr Saeed: Now listen and repeat.

23
00:01:47.084 --> 00:01:49.606
Mr Saeed: I'm Fahad.

24
00:01:51.306 --> 00:01:54.202
Mr Saeed: What's your name?

25
00:01:56.102 --> 00:01:58.793
Mr Saeed: My name's Sara.

26
00:02:00.693 --> 00:02:02.299
Mr Saeed: Nice to meet you.

27
00:02:07.399 --> 00:02:10.632
Mr Saeed: Quick quiz! Choose the right word.

28
00:02:10.632 --> 00:02:15.387
Mr Saeed: Blank name's Omar. My, or your?

29
00:02:17.687 --> 00:02:19.731
Fahad: My name's Omar.

30
00:02:19.731 --> 00:02:24.697
Mr Saeed: What's, blank, name? I, or your?

31
00:02:26.997 --> 00:02:29.686
Sara: What's your name?

32
00:02:29.686 --> 00:02:34.894
Mr Saeed: I, blank, Fahad. Am, or is?

33
00:02:37.194 --> 00:02:39.724
Fahad: I am Fahad. I'm Fahad.

34
00:02:42.124 --> 00:02:45.420
Mr Saeed: Now it's your turn. Say your name.

35
00:02:50.820 --> 00:02:53.455
Mr Saeed: Well done! See you in lesson two.
